---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Lonus">
	<main class="min-h-[85vh] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-[#E4DCF4]/90 font-['Poppins']">
		<a
			href="/"
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-8 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-[#E4DCF4]/70 hover:text-white bg-[#16141a] border border-[#4D465D]/60 hover:border-green-500 transition-all duration-150"
		>
			&larr; Back to Bio
		</a>

		<h1 class="text-white text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<div class="w-20 min-h-[3px] bg-green-500 rounded-2xl mb-8"></div>

		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E4DCF4]/80">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>
					We respect your privacy. When you purchase a digital asset, we or our Merchant of Record collect standard contact information (such as your name and email address) necessary to deliver your digital purchase and provide customer support. We do not store sensitive payment card details on our servers.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">2. How We Use Information</h2>
				<p>
					Collected information is used exclusively to:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 pl-2">
					<li>Deliver digital files, license keys, and order confirmations.</li>
					<li>Provide technical assistance and handle refund requests.</li>
					<li>Comply with applicable legal, accounting, and taxation requirements.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">3. Third-Party Payment Processors</h2>
				<p>
					Payments are processed securely through our authorized Merchant of Record (including Dodo Payments). Your financial details are handled in accordance with PCI-DSS compliance standards and the processor's respective privacy policy.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">4. Data Retention & Your Rights</h2>
				<p>
					You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. We retain purchase records only as long as necessary for fulfillment and legal tax compliance.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2">5. Contact Us</h2>
				<p>
					For privacy inquiries or data requests, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@hatsalsa.com" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">support@hatsalsa.com</a>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
	html {
		background-color: #0a0b0f;
	}
</style>
